{"3868590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Excommunication", "steam_appid": 3868590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A solo study project developed within 10 months.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868590/extras/3387b2b9801099f383453f9e9db244bb.avif?t=1754739250\" width=1600 height=491 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Hack &amp; Slash Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, brutal combat in a dynamic hack-and-slash world. Charge through linear levels filled with relentless enemies, visceral melee encounters, and explosive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purge the Heretics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: cleanse each level of all heretical presence. Face waves of corrupted foes, complete sacred objectives, and restore divine order to the artificial realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Task-Based Advancement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers unique objectives and escalating difficulty. Completing these tasks not only drives the story forward, but unlocks deeper layers of the uprising and your own strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Talents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you’ll discover powerful pickups. These allow you to unlock and choose from a range of talents that enhance your combat style be it aggressive, tactical, or relentless. Every choice tailors your crusade to your preferred way of purging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush the Revolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heretics are rising. Their false gospel spreads through steel and circuits. But you are the blade of judgment. End their revolution with fire, steel, and righteous fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i> </i><br><i>~ Ashes to ashes. Dust to dust. We are but dust, and to dust we shall return. Amen.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A solo study project developed within 10 months.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868590/extras/3387b2b9801099f383453f9e9db244bb.avif?t=1754739250\" width=1600 height=491 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Hack &amp; Slash Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, brutal combat in a dynamic hack-and-slash world. Charge through linear levels filled with relentless enemies, visceral melee encounters, and explosive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purge the Heretics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: cleanse each level of all heretical presence. Face waves of corrupted foes, complete sacred objectives, and restore divine order to the artificial realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Task-Based Advancement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers unique objectives and escalating difficulty. Completing these tasks not only drives the story forward, but unlocks deeper layers of the uprising and your own strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Talents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you’ll discover powerful pickups. These allow you to unlock and choose from a range of talents that enhance your combat style be it aggressive, tactical, or relentless. Every choice tailors your crusade to your preferred way of purging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush the Revolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heretics are rising. Their false gospel spreads through steel and circuits. But you are the blade of judgment. End their revolution with fire, steel, and righteous fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i> </i><br><i>~ Ashes to ashes. Dust to dust. We are but dust, and to dust we shall return. Amen.</i></p>", "short_description": "The renegade Angloids and wayward souls forge plans within the artificial realms, let them burn in the surreal 'hack and slash'. Excommunication is an artistic experience in which the heretics dream of uprising. But let steel be your answer. No heretic shall remain.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868590/66998885dca2d371825753230471b4b66e07e728/header.jpg?t=1754739250", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868590/c1dc689ec7365c1835ecfe04d99c39eb6ffb9641/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754739250", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868590/c1dc689ec7365c1835ecfe04d99c39eb6ffb9641/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754739250", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 10th 10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended